---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { epk } from '../data/epk.js'
import '../styles/epk.css'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Noa Saitoshii EPK: DJ & Multidisciplinary Artist"
  description="The electronic press kit for San Francisco DJ and multidisciplinary artist Noa Saitoshii: music, biography, selected performance history, formats, and booking contact."
  noindex={true}
>
  <article class="epk">
    <header class="epk-hero page-shell">
      <div class="epk-hero__copy" data-reveal>
        <h1>Noa<br />Saitoshii</h1>
        <p class="epk-hero__positioning">{epk.positioning}</p>
        <p class="epk-hero__introduction">{epk.introduction}</p>
        <div class="epk-actions" aria-label="EPK primary actions">
          <a class="button" href="#listen">Listen</a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="#proof">Performance proof</a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="mailto:contact@saitoshii.com">Email booking inquiry</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="epk-portrait" data-reveal>
        <div class="epk-portrait__frame">
          <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Portrait of Noa Saitoshii" width="400" height="400" />
        </div>
        <figcaption><span>Noa Saitoshii</span><span>San Francisco · Metaverse</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <nav class="epk-nav page-shell" aria-label="EPK sections" data-reveal>
      <a href="#listen">Music</a><a href="#profile">Profile</a><a href="#proof">Performance</a>
      <a href="#saitoshiia">Saitoshiia</a><a href="#assets">Assets</a><a href="#booking">Booking</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="epk-facts page-shell" aria-label="Artist facts" data-reveal>
      {epk.capabilities.map(([label, value]) => <div class="epk-fact"><p class="micro-label">{label}</p><p>{value}</p></div>)}
    </section>

    <section class="epk-section page-shell" id="listen" aria-labelledby="listen-title">
      <div class="epk-section__heading" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="listen-title">A journey, not a genre shelf.</h2>
        <p>Noa’s sets are programmed as emotional arcs: warmth and space at the opening, pressure when the room is ready, and release that feels earned.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="epk-music" data-reveal>
        {epk.music.map((set, index) => (
          <a class:list={['epk-music__row', { 'epk-music__row--featured': index === 0 }]} href={set.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span class="epk-music__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <span class="epk-music__title"><small>{set.role}</small><strong>{set.title}</strong><span>{set.descriptor}</span></span>
            <span class="epk-music__note">{set.note}</span>
            <span class="epk-music__action">Listen on SoundCloud <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="epk-section page-shell" id="profile" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
      <div class="epk-section__heading" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="profile-title">Music, atmosphere, and a room worth entering.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="epk-bio" data-reveal>
        <div class="epk-bio__short">
          <p class="micro-label">Short biography · Press ready</p>
          <p data-short-bio>{epk.shortBio}</p>
          <div class="epk-bio__actions">
            <button class="epk-copy" type="button" data-copy-bio><span data-copy-label>Copy short bio</span></button>
            <a class="epk-copy" href="/epk/bios.txt" download>Download both bios</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="epk-bio__long"><p class="micro-label">Full biography</p>{epk.longBio.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="epk-section page-shell" id="proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
      <div class="epk-section__heading" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="proof-title">Trusted in consequential rooms.</h2>
        <p>Selected credits are categorized by the relationship the event actually proves. No implied endorsements, inflated billing, or logo-wall shorthand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="epk-proof" data-reveal>
        {epk.proof.map((item, index) => item.href ? (
          <a class="epk-proof__row" href={item.href}>
            <span class="epk-proof__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span class="epk-proof__relationship">{item.relationship}</span>
            <strong>{item.artist}</strong><span class="epk-proof__context">{item.context}</span><p>{item.detail}</p><span class="epk-proof__link">View event →</span>
          </a>
        ) : (
          <div class="epk-proof__row">
            <span class="epk-proof__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span class="epk-proof__relationship">{item.relationship}</span>
            <strong>{item.artist}</strong><span class="epk-proof__context">{item.context}</span><p>{item.detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <aside class="epk-media-note" data-reveal aria-labelledby="live-media-title">
        <div><p class="micro-label">Live media</p><h3 id="live-media-title">The footage library is being curated.</h3></div>
        <p>This preview deliberately uses documented event context instead of presenting an unreviewed clip as the definitive live reel. The final press release adds one concise performance reel and credited stills after rights and quality review.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="epk-section page-shell" id="saitoshiia" aria-labelledby="saitoshiia-title">
      <div class="epk-world" data-reveal>
        <div class="epk-world__masthead"><h2 id="saitoshiia-title">Saitoshiia</h2><p class="epk-world__statement">The event practice behind the artist.</p></div>
        <div class="epk-world__copy">
          <p>Saitoshiia is the world, organization, and international event community founded and creatively directed by Noa. It connects original Final Fantasy XIV venues, recurring electronic-music events, livestreams, hospitality, and IRL collaborations into one authored experience.</p>
          <p>For a booker, that work demonstrates more than visual taste: Noa understands programming, audience flow, identity, technical coordination, guest experience, and the operational care required to make a room feel coherent.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://saitoshiia.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Enter Saitoshiia ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="epk-section page-shell" id="assets" aria-labelledby="assets-title">
      <div class="epk-section__heading" data-reveal><h2 id="assets-title">Ready to describe. Assets in review.</h2></div>
      <div class="epk-assets" data-reveal>
        <div><p class="micro-label">Approved spelling</p><strong>Noa Saitoshii</strong><p>DJ · Multidisciplinary artist · Founder and creative director of Saitoshiia</p></div>
        <div><p class="micro-label">Available now</p><p>Short biography · Full biography · Downloadable bio sheet · Official links · Booking contact</p></div>
        <div><p class="micro-label">Release gate</p><p>The downloadable press bundle remains withheld until horizontal and square photographs, logos, credits, usage rights, and provenance have been reviewed together.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="epk-booking page-shell" id="booking" aria-labelledby="booking-title" data-reveal>
      <div><h2 id="booking-title">Bring Noa into the room.</h2><p>Bookings, direct support, B2B appearances, livestreams, collaborations, and press.</p></div>
      <div class="epk-booking__actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:contact@saitoshii.com">Email booking inquiry</a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@saitoshii.com">contact@saitoshii.com</a></div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <script>
    const button = document.querySelector('[data-copy-bio]')
    const bio = document.querySelector('[data-short-bio]')
    const label = document.querySelector('[data-copy-label]')
    button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!bio || !label) return
      try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(bio.textContent.trim()); label.textContent = 'Bio copied' }
      catch { label.textContent = 'Select the bio to copy' }
      window.setTimeout(() => { label.textContent = 'Copy short bio' }, 2400)
    })
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
